WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.912
Section 1.

00:00:01.862 --> 00:00:04.600
National Shipbuilding Strategy.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:09.687
The promise was a generational program to rebuild the Royal Canadian Navy.

00:00:09.687 --> 00:00:19.400
The reality is the most expensive shipbuilding program on Earth, failing to deliver completed combat ships while costs exploded to 60 billion dollars.
